"deletions":52}}},{"hash":"ee081064c4812b3519315bad42e23d84edf2600c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task collection into TaskList","messageBody":"Encapsulate Remy\u0027s mutable ArrayList in TaskList and delegate task addition, indexed access, removal, size checks, and task snapshots to it. Loading now replaces the task collection atomically, while UI rendering and persistence receive read-only task copies to keep the collection\u0027s mutation boundary explicit.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":86,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"2969cf75397acc5bf7c481d51144e13d81da754b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task persistence into Storage","messageBody":"Move task-file loading, atomic saving, and saved-task deserialization from Remy into Storage. Add DateParser as a shared utility so command handling and persistence retain one authoritative set of supported date formats, while Remy only coordinates storage failures.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":321,"deletions":241}}},{"hash":"b8634577d421ec10e39a109e67df9f58690b5ff2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command parsing into Parser","messageBody":"Move command recognition, task-index validation, and todo/deadline/event construction from Remy into Parser. Keep Remy responsible for command orchestration and task-list operations, while reducing CommandType to a pure command enum and preserving every existing command response.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":218,"deletions":172}}},{"hash":"f05bfbb192ad02e3307dcbc8f160e8a3466a0dc6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Complete Ui ownership of user-facing output","messageBody":"Move mark and unmark confirmations from Task to Ui, and route storage failure messages through Ui as well. Task now changes only its completion state, leaving Ui as the sole class that writes to the console while preserving message content and ordering.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":44,"deletions":20}}},{"hash":"afb2f1ebe678dabf49627beaa29bb3deef9b1aff","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move console input handling into Ui","messageBody":"Give Ui ownership of the Scanner lifecycle and expose a readCommand method for the application loop. Remy now coordinates commands without directly reading from or closing System.in, completing Ui\u0027s responsibility for console interaction.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":25,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"d337786dcf5301dbe4b0d24f4b489ca5a8851b7e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Introduce executable command classes","messageBody":"Have Parser produce command objects that execute against TaskList, Ui, and Storage. Extract add, delete, list, mark/unmark, and exit behaviours from Remy\u0027s switch statement, leaving the application loop responsible only for parsing, execution, and exit control while preserving existing responses and persistence.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":183,"deletions":150}}},{"hash":"abf30f2e816062ef471ebe2d396f6a1c526afe62","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-MoreOOP\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"5ecd703b5f0f3b79686d03295007236b196e55e4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move to ui folder","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":151,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"7f429149303b63b8add50e4e73bd4e3bc561c3ac","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move to task folder","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":341,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"4fd437e97dcda408d24584221c266137c499d2a6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move to storage folder","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":240,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"98858307159717c23a07e0ce2c4512ac78662739","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move to parser folder","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"ins